{title: Tere Bina}
{artist: Mustafa Zahid Heropanti}
{key: A#}

{c: Verse 1}
Ik [A#] khoya khoya chaand tha,        [Gm] Jo tha khafa khafa
Ik [A#] toota toota khwaab tha,        [Gm] Jo tujhse tha juda
Ik [D#] aadhi aadhi aas thi,        Jo [A#] poori ho gayi
Tum [D#] mill gaye to jaane kyun,        Ye [F] doori ho gayi
[A#] Piya laage [D#] na,        [A#] Jiya laage [D#] na
Tere [Cm] binaa.. [F] ..tere [Gm] bina,        Tere [Cm] binaa.. [F] ..tere [A#] bina
[A#] .. [Gm] .. [D#] .. [Cm],        Ho [A#] aadhi adhoori
[Gm] Iss dastaan mein,        [D#] Kaise koyi rang [F] laaye
[Cm] Kaise koyi [A#] muskuraaye,        [A#] Itne ghamon mein
[Gm] Do pal khushi ke,        [D#] Kaise bhala yaad [F] aayein
[Cm] Tumko bhula naa [A#] paayein,        Ik [A#] pyaasi pyaasi boond mein
[Gm] Jo mann mera jalaa,        Har [A#] lamha lamha teri hi
[Gm] Yaadon se tha ye bhara,        Ik [D#] aadhi aadhi aas thi
Jo [A#] poori ho gayi,        Tum [D#] mill gaye to jaane kyun
Ye [F] doori ho gayi,        [A#] Piya laage [D#] na
[A#] Jiya laage [D#] na,        Tere [Cm] binaa.. [F] ..tere [Gm] bina
Tere [Cm] binaa.. [F] ..tere [A#] bina
